From 497f9c49952e4f27502b926bc169ee45838e8864 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:20:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD selected-agent slash command routing so commands
 bypass normal prompts

Selected chat messages that start with a slash are treated as provider-native commands for the active agent session. This keeps commands such as /status and /fork on the backend command execution path, so providers receive the raw command instead of a normal prompt.
